Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf61": "<h2 id=\"第-61-法-干乘墓虎无占病-必死无疑\">第 61 法　干乘墓虎无占病：必死无疑</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　不利交兵接刃</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"墓虎加干格-必死无疑\">墓虎加干格：必死无疑</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓六辛日丑加戌昼将乘白虎作墓神，内辛酉日丑为空亡尤可畏也。至辛巳日可畏愈甚，缘丑作丁神乘虎作墓，占病必死，诸占丑昏且迷，又凶恶，防仇人冤执而遭挫楚。如冬占稍轻，缘丑至冬旺可作库说。外有六乙日昼贵顺行，虽是未乘白虎，上有临行年本命上者，即无加干者也，夏占稍轻，缘未旺亦为库也，余干无此例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 61 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日墓覆干又乘白虎，为墓虎加干。占病主必死；六辛日第十局丑加戌最的，辛酉日丑空尤凶，辛巳日丑又作丁神更险。冬占丑旺可作库论，凶稍轻；六乙日未乘白虎临行年本命亦可同断，夏占稍轻。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛亥日第 10 局　月将 酉 加占时 午　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 申 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：墓虎加干格 · 辛亥日第十局，辛墓丑临干乘白虎（据书图三传巳申亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎鬼加干格-极凶之课\">虎鬼加干格：极凶之课</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">虎鬼加干格，如六己日卯加己夜，六壬日戌加壬昼夜，六癸日戌加癸昼，皆是日鬼加干而乘白虎。占病讼战斗杀诸事，皆凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 61 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼临干又乘白虎，为虎鬼加干。占病、讼、战、斗杀均主极凶。书图以己巳日第五局为例，卯木为己土日鬼，夜占乘白虎。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己巳日第 5 局　月将 巳 加占时 酉　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>辰</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 5 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>巳</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：虎鬼加干格 · 己巳日第五局，卯为日鬼加己夜占乘白虎（据书图三传卯亥未注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：干墓乘白虎，占病必死、诸事凶恶昏迷</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干墓乘白虎（昼将）作墓神。</p>\n<p>⭐ 占病必死，诸事凶恶昏迷，防仇人冤执遭棰楚；冬占丑旺作库稍轻。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔疾病墓虎〕</span>干墓白虎：日干上乘日墓又乘白虎，人身入墓而虎伤，病象重。　<strong>用法</strong>：必须查年命救神、虎是否空或自战；非病占可主人身困顿。</p>\n<hr>", "bf62": "<h2 id=\"第-62-法-支乘墓虎有伏尸-家有丧事\">第 62 法　支乘墓虎有伏尸：家有丧事</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　大过九三栋挠凶，不利深沟高垒</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支乘墓虎格-宅动孝服\">支乘墓虎格：宅动孝服</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">此例有二等，一者干墓临支，二者支墓临支。以上二例占宅必有伏尸鬼祸或有形响，如又克宅者为的。假令乙亥日未为干墓临支而克支，如昼占上乘白虎。第二等者，假令丙子日辰加子昼占，乃支墓临支而克支乘虎。如占家宅值此课者，必家中有孝服动或有丧吊，其年内必有停丧，尤详其墓属何类而言何人死。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 62 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干墓或支墓乘白虎临支，为支乘墓虎。占宅主伏尸、鬼祸、形响、孝服动；若墓神又克宅，更为的验。乙亥日第五局属干墓临支克支，丙子日第九局属支墓临支克支。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙亥日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（涉害·见机）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 卯 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>卯</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 5 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>寅</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：支乘墓虎格（一）· 乙亥日第五局，未为干墓临支克支乘白虎（据书图三传未卯亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支乘墓虎格-二-宅动孝服\">支乘墓虎格（二）：宅动孝服</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">如丙子日辰加子昼占，乃支墓临支而克支乘虎。如乙亥日未土妻财乘虎为墓临支，是丧妻；丙子日辰墓乘虎临支，辰土为丙干子孙，则主有儿女之丧。又有丁亥日辰加亥夜占，皆属此格。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 62 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支墓临支克支而乘白虎，亦为支乘墓虎。占家宅主丧吊孝服，须以墓神类象断为何人之丧。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：支乘墓虎格（二）· 丙子日第九局，辰墓临子支克支乘白虎（据书图三传酉丑巳注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎鬼克支格-家有丧事\">虎鬼克支格：家有丧事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">虎鬼克支格，缘支鬼乘白虎而克支者。例如壬子日戌加子昼，丁丑日寅加丑夜，壬寅日返吟夜，癸卯日申加卯夜，壬午日返吟昼，乙未、己未日卯加未夜，丙申日午加申昼，癸亥日戌加亥，昼夜皆乘白虎。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 62 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支鬼乘白虎克支，为虎鬼克支格。占宅主丧事。书图以壬子日第三局为例，戌加子，昼占乘白虎克支。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>寅</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 3 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>辰</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：虎鬼克支格 · 壬子日第三局，戌加子昼占，支鬼乘白虎克支（据书图三传戌申午注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"墓门开格-重重丧事\">墓门开格：重重丧事</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">墓门开格，如卯酉日占，干墓乘蛇虎加支，主重重有丧。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 62 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　卯、酉日占，干墓乘腾蛇、白虎而加支，为墓门开格。主重重丧事，病占则凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛酉日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 午 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：墓门开格 · 辛酉日第九局，干墓乘蛇虎加支（据书图三传寅午戌注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"蛇墓克支格-频见怪异\">蛇墓克支格：频见怪异</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">蛇墓克支格，缘干墓乘腾蛇而加支又克支者，必宅内怪异频见。如丙子日戌加子夜，壬子日辰加子夜，余有虽临支而不克者稍轻，然亦未免怪异。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 62 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干墓乘腾蛇加支并克支，为蛇墓克支格。占宅主怪异频见；若临支而不克，凶灾稍轻。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 亥 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>寅</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 3 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>辰</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：蛇墓克支格 · 丙子日第三局，干墓乘腾蛇加支又克支（据书图三传丑亥酉注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：干支墓乘虎临支，宅有伏尸鬼祸或丧动</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干墓或支墓乘白虎临支，又克支。</p>\n<p>⭐ 占宅必有伏尸鬼祸或丧动、其年有停丧；详墓属何类断何人死。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔疾病墓虎〕</span>支墓伏尸：支宅上乘支墓白虎，可主宅中病丧、旧葬、伏尸。　<strong>用法</strong>：具体应何人，须看墓虎所作六亲类神，不可笼统断全家。</p>\n<hr>", "bf63": "<h2 id=\"第-63-法-彼此全伤防两损-两败俱伤\">第 63 法　彼此全伤防两损：两败俱伤</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　鹬蚌相持，渔人坐收其利</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"全伤格-两方受损\">全伤格：两方受损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓支干各被上神克伐者，故名此例。如占讼必两家皆被扑责。诸占必两边各有所亏，如占身被伤，占宅崩损。如丁亥日干上子水克丁火，支上辰土克亥水之类是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 63 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干与支各被其上神克制，为全伤格。占讼主两家皆受责备；占身主己身被伤；占宅主宅屋崩损；占交易等事，后有龃龉，若先有龃龉，后反有和合。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁亥日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 戌 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：全伤格（一）· 丁亥日第八局，支干各被上神克伐（据书图三传巳戌卯注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"全伤格-二-两方受损\">全伤格（二）：两方受损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">辛未日干上午，支上卯，如占交易等事，后必龃龉，如先有龃龉，后却和合。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 63 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　辛未日第五局亦为全伤格。干上、支上皆受克伐，主彼此俱伤。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛未日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 亥 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>卯</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 5 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>寅</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：全伤格（二）· 辛未日第五局，彼此全伤（据书图三传卯亥未注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（刑墓）：支干各被上神克伐，两家皆亏、身伤宅损</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　支干各被上神克伐。</p>\n<p>⭐ 占讼两家皆被扑责、诸占两边各亏、身伤宅损。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔人宅吉凶〕</span>彼此全伤：干支彼此互克，上下皆伤，主宾两败、人宅俱损。　<strong>用法</strong>：婚合讼斗不宜强争；有中神通关或德合方可调停。</p>\n<hr>", "bf64": "<h2 id=\"第-64-法-夫妇芜淫各有私-各有私情\">第 64 法　夫妇芜淫各有私：各有私情</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　两敌阴相图议</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"芜淫卦-夫妻各有私情\">芜淫卦：夫妻各有私情</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓干被支上神克，支却被干上神克者，为芜淫卦，既名芜淫，何又云夫妇各有私乎？缘夫妇乃人之大伦，既无夫妇好合之情，必有好私不协之意，却详何处有情而言夫妇之私情也。如《心镜》中以甲子日干上戌、支上申一课为例。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 64 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干受支上神克，支受干上神克，为芜淫卦。夫妻相合为大伦，既不相合，便主各怀私意。书图以甲子日第五局为例，申子相生、水合金，故从“有情处”断私情。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 5 局　月将 寅 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 午 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>卯</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 5 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>寅</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：芜淫卦 · 甲子日第五局，干支互受上神克而各有私情（据书图三传戌午寅注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"真解离卦-夫妻反目\">真解离卦：夫妻反目</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">真解离卦，缘干克支上神，支克干上神，或夫妇行年又值此者尤的。如甲子日第九局，干上午，支上辰，干克支上辰土，支克干上午火，如男命行年在支上，女命行年在干上，此时占人必占解离事。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 64 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干克支上神、支克干上神，为真解离卦。主夫妻反目，若夫妻行年又临其上，必主解离之事。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：真解离卦 · 甲子日第九局，干克支上辰土、支克干上午火（据书图三传辰申子注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（刑墓）：干支互被对方上神克，无好合情、有奸私意</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　干被支上神克、支却被干上神克（芜淫卦）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 无夫妇好合之情、有奸私不协之意；干支行年值此为真解离。不可专执为夫妇。</p>\n<hr>", "bf65": "<h2 id=\"第-65-法-干墓并关人宅废-人衰屋废\">第 65 法　干墓并关人宅废：人衰屋废</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　关即寡也</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"干墓作关神发用格-人衰宅废\">干墓作关神发用格：人衰宅废</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干之墓作四季之关神发用者是也。宜分干支发用。如日干之两课上作发用者，主人衰；如支辰之两课上发用者，主宅废。夫关神者，春丑、夏辰、秋未、冬戌。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 65 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干之墓又作四季关神并发用，为干墓作关神发用。临干两课发用主人口衰弱；临支两课发用主宅屋颓废。关神与寡宿同煞，春丑、夏辰、秋未、冬戌。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁卯日第 6 局　月将 丑 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 巳 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>子</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 6 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>丑</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：干墓作关神发用格 · 丁卯日第六局冬占，戌作关神又作干墓发用（据书图三传戌巳子注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"墓神覆日作生气格-得库务之差\">墓神覆日作生气格：得库务之差</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">墓神覆日作生气格，如占作库务差遣必得，勿作墓看之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 65 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　墓神覆日但又作月生气，则不按墓神断。占库务差遣，反主可得。书图以甲子日第八局八月占为例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 巳 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：墓神覆日作生气格 · 甲子日第八局八月占，墓神覆日作生气（据书图三传子巳戌注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（家宅）：日干之墓作四季关神发用，主人衰宅废</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干之墓作四季关神（春丑夏辰秋未冬戌）发用。</p>\n<p>⭐ 干两课上发用主人衰、支两课上发用主宅废；若作库务差遣反得，勿作墓看。</p>\n<hr>", "bf66": "<h2 id=\"第-66-法-支坟财并旅程稽-商贩折本\">第 66 法　支坟财并旅程稽：商贩折本</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　钟邓终没于蜀</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支墓作财格-诸谋不通\">支墓作财格：诸谋不通</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓地支之墓作日干之财者，必主商贩折本，在路阻程，凡谋塞滞不亨通也。如甲子日辰加子，乃支之墓神而作干之财为发用；甲午日戌加寅用，甲午日戌加子用，乙酉日丑加辰用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 66 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　支之墓神作日财并发用，为支墓作财。占商旅主折本，在路主阻滞，诸谋不通。书图以甲子日第九局、甲午日第三局为例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：支墓作财格（一）· 甲子日第九局，辰为支墓又作日财发用（据书图三传辰申子注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"支墓作财格-二-诸谋不通\">支墓作财格（二）：诸谋不通</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">甲午日戌加寅用，甲午日戌加子用，乙酉日丑加辰用，皆支墓作日财发用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 66 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　甲午日第三局为支墓作财另一例，主商贩折本、旅程稽滞。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲午日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 子 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>寅</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 3 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>辰</strong>，占时与三传不变。 <span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>戌→申→午</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>寅→子→戌</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：支墓作财格（二）· 甲午日第三局，戌为午支墓又作甲财发用（据书图三传戌申午注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"疑惑格-进退不定\">疑惑格：进退不定</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">疑惑格，卯酉日占事。如行年又在卯酉之上者，必行人进退疑惑，此《心镜》内龙战卦中具载，尤忌天车煞。天车煞者，春丑、夏辰、秋未、冬戌也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 66 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　卯、酉日占事，行年又临卯酉，为疑惑格。主行人进退不定，疑惑不决，尤忌天车煞。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（家宅）：地支之墓作日财，商贩折本、在路阻程</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　地支之墓作日干之财。</p>\n<p>⭐ 主商贩折本、在路阻程，凡谋蹇滞不通。</p>\n<hr>", "bf67": "<h2 id=\"第-67-法-受虎克神为病症-病症推断\">第 67 法　受虎克神为病症：病症推断</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　受虎克之国民流兵疫</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎鬼格-以白虎断病\">虎鬼格：以白虎断病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">金神乘白虎，必是肝经受病，可治肺而不可治肝。木神乘白虎，必是脾经受病，可治肝而不可治脾。水神乘白虎，必是心经受病，可治肾而不可治心。火神乘白虎，必是肺经受病，可治心而不可治肺。土神乘白虎，必是肾经受病，可治脾而不可治肾。以上诸法，常得灵验，惟虎受克及空亡，不必治也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　白虎所乘之神，以五行克处定病位：金虎主肝，木虎主脾，水虎主心，火虎主肺，土虎主肾。治法取病因所在之脏，不直接治被病之脏。若白虎受克或空亡，则病不治可愈。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"运粮神格-食神占病\">运粮神格：食神占病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">运粮神格，占治病专视日干之食神，尤妙；于行年乘之，乃名运粮神，忌空。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　子孙为克制官鬼之神，又为食神，故名日运粮神。若临行年、本命，病人食欲尚可为喜；若落空，则食欲不振为忌。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"禄粮神格-占病必死\">禄粮神格：占病必死</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">禄粮神格，缘宜观干之禄神，亦名禄粮神，惟不可落空亡，及作闭口或受克。如占久病值此，必绝食而饿死。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日禄为禄粮神。久病占得日禄落空、闭口、受克，主绝食而凶。书图以辛未日第六局为例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛未日第 6 局　月将 丑 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 辰 → 亥</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>子</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 6 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>丑</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：禄粮神格 · 辛未日第六局，日禄为粮神，忌空亡闭口受克（据书图三传酉辰亥注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"生死格-生气死气断疾病\">生死格：生气死气断疾病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">生死格，宜观生气死气尤验。如正月生气在子，死气在午，乃生气克死气也。如在甲寅旬中占之，乃生气空亡而死气实在，占病可畏。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　生气、死气并临时，以二者克制、空实判断病势。生气克死气或年命助生气则可愈；死气克生气且死气实在，则病情堪忧。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 4 局　月将 卯 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 卯 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：生死格 · 丙子日第四局正月占，生气死气并临（据书图三传午卯子注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎乘丁鬼格-断疼痛处方法之一\">虎乘丁鬼格：断疼痛处方法之一</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">虎乘丁鬼格，如六辛日有白虎乘丁者。占病必知所患疼痛之处也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　六辛日白虎乘丁神，占病可断疼痛所在。白虎临戌亥子丑寅卯为头，临辰巳午未申酉依次推其身体部位。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛卯日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 酉 → 未</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原记月将 <strong>寅</strong>，与<q class=\"yw\">第 3 局</q>不合（<code>off = 13 − 局数</code>，全库 270/282 张盘符合此式，<code>bfp()</code> 生成的 79 张亦用此式）；已改为 <strong>辰</strong>，占时与三传不变。 原书注：虎乘丁鬼格 · 辛卯日第三局，白虎乘丁神可断疼痛处（据书图三传亥酉未注入）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"虎墓格-积块之病\">虎墓格：积块之病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">虎墓格，缘日干之墓乘白虎在六处者。如占病必是积块病，宜以破积药治之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干之墓乘白虎临六处，为虎墓格。占病主积块，宜破积药。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"空禄格-绝食饿死\">空禄格：绝食饿死</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">空禄格，缘日之禄神作空亡又坐克方，占病必绝食而饿死。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日禄空亡又坐受克之方，为空禄格。占病主绝食凶亡。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"禄神闭口格-疾病难愈\">禄神闭口格：疾病难愈</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">禄神闭口格，缘禄神作闭口，为旬尾乘白虎者是也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日禄作旬尾闭口，又乘白虎，为禄神闭口格，主病人难以进食，疾病难愈。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"六片板格-死尸入棺\">六片板格：死尸入棺</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">六片板格，缘六合乘申临卯，为尸入棺。缘申者身也，于三月占尤的。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　申乘六合临卯，为六片板格，象死尸入棺，占病尤凶。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"白虎入丧车格-占病最忌\">白虎入丧车格：占病最忌</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">白虎入丧车格，缘申加巳发用为的，占病可畏。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　申加巳发用，为白虎入丧车。占病最忌。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"人入鬼门格-占病必死\">人入鬼门格：占病必死</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">人入鬼门格，如庚日申为本命，返吟课占病必死。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　庚日申为本命而得返吟课，为人入鬼门，病占必死。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"寒热格-瘴病\">寒热格：瘴病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">寒热格，如巳午加亥子，如或克日，主疟病，十干返吟必心中惊异。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　巳、午加亥、子，或克日，为寒热格，主寒热往来、瘴疟之病。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"宴喜致病格-因宴饮得病\">宴喜致病格：因宴饮得病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">宴喜致病格，如辛酉、癸亥、癸丑三日并支上未作太常为用，夜将有之。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　太常主宴饮，乘神临干克干或临支克支，为宴喜致病，主因宴饮而病。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"因妻致病格-因去妻家得病\">因妻致病格：因去妻家得病</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">因妻致病格，如壬子、癸丑二日，未通丁干者，必往妻家得病极验。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　未土为妻财，又通丁神临干，主因去妻家或妻家之事得病。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"血厌病虎作鬼格-血光之症\">血厌病虎作鬼格：血光之症</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">血厌病虎作鬼格，血支血忌、月厌、病符、白虎作日鬼者，主血光之症。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 67 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　血支、血忌、月厌、病符与白虎作日鬼并见，主血光、损伤、病势深重。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：白虎所克之神定病位，可治其所生之脏</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　白虎所乘之神克某五行，定其病位。</p>\n<p>⭐ 金虎肝病、木虎脾病、水虎心病、火虎肺病、土虎肾病；可治其所生之脏，而不可治所病之脏。</p>\n<hr>", "bf68": "<h2 id=\"第-68-法-制鬼之位乃良医-以日鬼断医治\">第 68 法　制鬼之位乃良医：以日鬼断医治</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　访贤求救于制鬼</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"救神临支格-家有良医\">救神临支格：家有良医</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">凡鬼普见者，惟妻占夫与有官人为宜，其余皆凶。巳午作虎鬼，不宜灸；申酉作虎鬼，不宜针。如乙丑日酉加巳，乃日之鬼，却赖支上有午火而克其酉金，此午火便是良医，或是本家亲人能医，或得家堂祖宗神位保护。除占病外，凡占虽值危难灾患之中，必得人解纷，诚为救神也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 68 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　克制日鬼之神就是救神、良医。若救神临支，病占主本家亲戚能医，或得家堂祖宗神位保护；其他占事，主危难中得人救解。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"病体难担荷格-饮食不当\">病体难担荷格：饮食不当</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">病体难担荷格，干上神、初传为财，无克制，主因饮食不当而得病，以致不救。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 68 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上神与初传作财而无克制，病体难以担荷，主因饮食不当成病，病势不轻。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"天医作虎鬼格-不宜求医\">天医作虎鬼格：不宜求医</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天医作虎鬼格，不宜医者治，虎乘干鬼，必有不明之人作祸。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 68 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　天医乘白虎而作日鬼，为天医作虎鬼。病占不宜求医，反防庸医或不明之人作祸。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：克制日鬼之神即良医、食神，救难解祸</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　能克制日鬼之神（即日之食神）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 即良医、救神，或本家亲人能医、家堂祖宗保护；乘贵得上人释愆。若鬼空则救神无用（庸医）。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔疾病救神〕</span>制鬼良医：能克制日鬼的子孙之神，就是病占的良医和救药。　<strong>用法</strong>：救神临行年本命最贴身；乘贵人为名医，空亡则医药无力。</p>\n<hr>", "bf69": "<h2 id=\"第-69-法-虎乘遁鬼殃非浅-凶咎深埋\">第 69 法　虎乘遁鬼殃非浅：凶咎深埋</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　入险危之敌境，和遇伏藏之强寇</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"通鬼乘虎格-凶灾难解\">通鬼乘虎格：凶灾难解</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓白虎加临旬内之干为日鬼者例。此法应验如神，凡占缘旺其祸弥深，难以消除，纵空亡亦不能为救。如甲子日昼占，乃虎加庚午临戌为用，又昼占虎加庚午临子在支上，又昼占庚午作虎加干，或返吟。乙丑日昼占虎临辛未上加戌，戊辰日夜占虎临甲子加戌。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 69 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　旬内遁干作日鬼又乘白虎，为通鬼乘虎。暗鬼克身，凶咎深埋，难以消除，即使空亡也难救。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"明暗二鬼格-凶灾无救\">明暗二鬼格：凶灾无救</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">明暗二鬼格，乃干上神作日干明鬼，又支上神通自干作日干暗鬼。如六甲日申加甲、庚加支；六乙日酉加乙、庚加支；六丙日亥加丙、壬加支；六丁日子加丁、壬加支；六戊日寅加戊、甲加支；六己日卯加己、乙加支之类。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 69 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上神明作日鬼，支上神遁干又暗作日鬼，为明暗二鬼并临。占病讼灾祸，主明暗夹攻，凶灾无救。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（疾病）：白虎加临旬内遁干作日鬼，凶咎难消</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　白虎加临旬内遁干而作日鬼。</p>\n<p>⭐ 应验如神，凡占咎深难消，纵空亡亦不能为救。</p>\n<hr>", "bf70": "<h2 id=\"第-70-法-鬼临三四讼灾随-讼病相随\">第 70 法　鬼临三四讼灾随：讼病相随</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　先和好而后有兵谋</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"鬼临三四格-病讼连连\">鬼临三四格：病讼连连</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干之鬼临于第三四课全者。官词病患继踵而至，惟宜修德作福，及归正道，庶得稍轻，犹未免于病词二事也。如或全值空亡，始能免此，然亦且先见此而后无虑。如乙未日申加未为第三课，酉加申为第四课之类；如甲戌日酉加戌为第三课，申加酉为第四课，虽日鬼加临辰两课，尤幸皆作空亡，不能为害，似可无畏也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 70 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日鬼临第三、第四课，为鬼临三四。主官讼与病患接连而至，只宜修德归正以减轻；若两课日鬼皆空亡，灾可缓解。书中举乙未日第十二局、甲戌日第二局为例。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"岁破作鬼临支格-讼灾难免\">岁破作鬼临支格：讼灾难免</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">岁破作鬼临支格，如再克支辰，讼灾难免。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 70 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　岁破又作日鬼临支，且克支辰，为岁破作鬼临支。主讼灾难免。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"天鬼作日鬼格-灾病相随\">天鬼作日鬼格：灾病相随</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天鬼作日鬼格，天鬼又作日鬼者，灾病相随，尤忌乘凶将。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 70 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　天鬼煞又作日鬼，为天鬼作日鬼。主灾病相随，若再乘白虎等凶将更凶。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"朱勾相会格-讼牵文书\">朱勾相会格：讼牵文书</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">朱勾相会格，朱雀、勾陈相会，主词讼文书牵连。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 70 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　朱雀主文书口舌，勾陈主勾连争讼，二者相会，主文书、口舌、词讼牵连。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：日鬼临第三四课全，官词病患继踵而至</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干之鬼临于第三、四课全。</p>\n<p>⭐ 官词病患继踵而至，宜修德作福；若全值空亡始能免此。</p>\n<hr>"});